_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Drama","Romance","Comedy"],"id":8670,"type":"MOVIE","title":"A Good Year","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk45/shows/f08f897f-8841-440b-b4b8-cb97114387eb.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk57/shows/2476aced-2eb8-4545-878c-1069a1af018a.jpg","likes":66,"dislikes":0,"views":8359,"release_date":"1163116800000","length":7052,"description":"After years of no contact with his Uncle Henry, London banker and bond trader Max Skinner learns that Henry has died intestate, so Max inherits a château and vineyard in Provence. Max spent part of his childhood there, learning maxims and how to win and lose, and honing his killer instinct (at chess, which serves him well in finance). Max goes to France intent on selling the property. He spends a few days there, getting the property ready to show. Memories, a beautiful woman, and a young American who says she's Henry's illegitimate daughter interrupt his plans. Did Max the boy know things that Max the man has forgotten?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7}],"value":7,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":8670,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}